{"ok":true,"module":"io/output/d09","docs":{"io/output/d09/binding_port":{"type":"UInt16","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.binding_port.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.binding_port.help","enum_set":"flowio_binding_port_digital_output","label":"Port physique D09","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.binding_port.label","help":"Identifiant du port physique piloté par la sortie D09. Utiliser \"Non connecté\" pour laisser cette sortie logique non affectée.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.binding_port.help"},"io/output/d09/d09_active_high":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_active_high.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_active_high.help","label":"Actif à 1 D09","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_active_high.label","help":"Si vrai, D09 est active à l'état haut; sinon active-bas.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_active_high.help"},"io/output/d09/d09_initial_on":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_initial_on.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_initial_on.help","label":"État initial ON D09","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_initial_on.label","help":"État appliqué au démarrage pour la sortie D09.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_initial_on.help"},"io/output/d09/d09_momentary":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_momentary.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_momentary.help","label":"Mode impulsion D09","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_momentary.label","help":"Active un fonctionnement impulsionnel pour D09.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_momentary.help"},"io/output/d09/d09_name":{"type":"CharArray","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_name.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_name.help","label":"Nom sortie D09","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_name.label","help":"Nom lisible de la sortie digitale D09.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_name.help"},"io/output/d09/d09_pulse_ms":{"type":"Int32","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_pulse_ms.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_pulse_ms.help","unit":"ms","label":"Durée impulsion D09 (ms)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_pulse_ms.label","help":"Durée de l'impulsion automatique de D09.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.d09_pulse_ms.help"},"io/output/d09/retain_on_warm_reboot":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.retain_on_warm_reboot.help","enum_set":"io_output_boot_behavior","label":"Comportement au reboot D09","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help":"Choisit si D09 applique son état initial au démarrage ou tente de conserver le latch matériel lors d'un reboot chaud. Sur MCP23017, la conservation est ignorée et l'état initial est appliqué.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d09.retain_on_warm_reboot.help"}},"meta":{}}